{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16570","headline":"中秋与空上人同宿华严寺 · 冷朝阳","name":"中秋与空上人同宿华严寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"埽榻相逢宿，论诗旧梵宫。\n磬声迎鼓尽，月色过山穷。\n庭簇安禅草，窗飞带火虫。\n一宵何惜别，回首隔秋风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冷朝阳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16570.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16570","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}